":339.12,"end":343.52},{"text":"no, that laugh's okay.","start":344.32,"end":348.24},{"text":"that one i get to have.","start":348.24,"end":353.92},{"text":"hey.","start":353.92,"end":354.86},{"text":"hands off the wheel, see?","start":354.86,"end":356.42},{"text":"turning.","start":356.42,"end":359.71},{"text":"facing you.","start":359.71,"end":360.47},{"text":"full eye contact this is very hard for me right","start":361.31,"end":366.64},{"text":"now.","start":366.64,"end":367.84},{"text":"please note the effort.","start":368.1,"end":369.71},{"text":"here's the thing i actually mean, under all","start":369.94,"end":373.62},{"text":"the stupid.","start":373.62,"end":374.62},{"text":"i don't think you're going anywhere.","start":374.62,"end":378.01},{"text":"it was never really about him.","start":378.01,"end":381.69},{"text":"when you laughed like that, some small pathetic","start":381.69,"end":389.35},{"text":"part of me went","start":389.35,"end":391.72},{"text":"\"when's the last time i made her do that?\"","start":391.72,"end":399.72},{"text":"and i couldn't remember.","start":450.28,"end":450.43},{"text":"honestly, i thought my material was slipping.","start":450.43,"end":451.45},{"text":"no, listen— hey.","start":451.45,"end":454.85},{"text":"look at me.","start":454.85,"end":456.72},{"text":"last thing, then i'll stop being heavy, promise.","start":456.72,"end":461.71},{"text":"if i ever do that again the fine, fine, i'm","start":461.71,"end":467.9},{"text":"fine routine you're allowed to just","start":467.9,"end":471.54},{"text":"poke me.","start":471.69,"end":472.96},{"text":"in the ribs.","start":472.96,"end":474.69},{"text":"hard.","start":474.69,"end":475.25},{"text":"because marinating in it for an hour was so","start":475.25,"end":480.2},{"text":"much worse than just saying","start":480.2,"end":482.36},{"text":"\"i got scared watching you laugh at another","start":482.36,"end":487.41},{"text":"man's joke.\" which, out loud, is somehow both","start":487.41,"end":494.37},{"text":"more embarrassing and","start":494.37,"end":496.39},{"text":"lighter.","start":496.77,"end":497.8},{"text":"it's lighter now.","start":499.45,"end":500.58},{"text":"how is it lighter now?","start":502.38,"end":503.85},{"text":"because you didn't laugh at me.","start":503.85,"end":507.28},{"text":"yeah.","start":508.76,"end":509.96},{"text":"maybe that's it.","start":510.85,"end":512.02},{"text":"c'mere.","start":512.02,"end":515},{"text":"forehead.","start":515,"end":516.2},{"text":"just— there.","start":520.87,"end":522.29},{"text":"you smell like the party.","start":522.8,"end":525.78},{"text":"smoke and","start":525.78,"end":527.42},{"text":"somebody's terrible cologne.","start":527.42,"end":529.06},{"text":"not yours.","start":530.55,"end":531.32},{"text":"please not yours.","start":531.71,"end":533.08},{"text":"okay, his.","start":533.08,"end":535.9},{"text":"noted.","start":535.9,"end":537.3},{"text":"filing that away in a healthy, non-jealous","start":537.3,"end":542.01},{"text":"manner.","start":542.01,"end":543.21},{"text":"i'm sorry about the silent car ride.","start":544.23,"end":546.28},{"text":"longest ten minutes of my life, for the record.","start":547.77,"end":550.76},{"text":"every sentence i started began with \"so, that","start":551.49,"end":555.68},{"text":"guy,\"","start":555.68,"end":556.14},{"text":"and i knew how that would sound.","start":556.14,"end":558.92},{"text":"so i said nothing.","start":559.93,"end":560.94},{"text":"which sounded worse.","start":562.5,"end":563.75},{"text":"genius move.","start":564.52,"end":565.49},{"text":"you're warm.","start":565.49,"end":568.23},{"text":"stay like this a second.","start":568.23,"end":574.14},{"text":"just","start":574.14,"end":575.07},{"text":"one more second.","start":575.07,"end":577.86},{"text":"okay.","start":578.64,"end":579.72},{"text":"it's late.","start":579.72,"end":580.04},{"text":"you should go in.","start":580.04,"end":582.75},{"text":"but i'm walking you to the door.","start":582.75,"end":587.49},{"text":"slow.","start":587.49,"end":588.17},{"text":"embarrassingly slow.","start":588.17,"end":589.11},{"text":"old-man-with-a-newspaper slow.","start":589.11,"end":592.86},{"text":"because i did the math","start":593.11,"end":594.6},{"text":"and the door is only thirty feet away","start":594.6,"end":599},{"text":"and i'm not done being next to you yet.","start":599,"end":605.34},{"text":"yeah.","start":605.34,"end":606.05},{"text":"that was smoother than anything i said all","start":606.05,"end":610.01},{"text":"night, wasn't it.","start":610.01,"end":610.99},{"text":"don't tell the steering wheel.","start":610.99,"end":613.69},{"text":"it thinks i'm cool.","start":615.05,"end":616.16},{"text":"come on.","start":616.16,"end":618.49},{"text":"slow.","start":619.32,"end":621.32}]